{title: Somethings got a hold of me}

{comment: Chorus}
Somethings got a hold of me
Somethings got a hold of me
I went to the church one night, and my heart wasn’t
right.
Somethings got a hold of me

{comment: Verse 1}
It was at a revival on a mourners bench,
I was filled with misery.
The same God that touched my mother
He laid His hands on me, that’s why I say.

{comment: Verse 2}
They were singing “Come ye that loves the Lord”,
And I thought they were singing to me,
Something hit me up over my head
And run right to my feet. I never shall forget it.

{comment: Bridge}
It was the Holy Ghost (Holy Ghost) repeat?
